{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dice To Pay",
    "steam_appid": 3631830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based strategy game that combines dice and card mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fantasy world filled with spirits and magic, you play as a bounty hunter\u2026 looking to buy a house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Roll dice \u2192 Play skill cards \u2192 Defeat monsters \u2192 Earn rewards \u2192 Pay off your mortgage.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a story about saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one thing that never goes away\u2014your mortgage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time pressure. Take your time and plan each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unpredictable dice rolls, quirky enemies, and diverse skill cards, luck plays a part\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it\u2019s your judgment and strategy that will truly determine your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique cottages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each offers a different set of skills and playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five ascension levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock progressively harder challenges and test your strategic limits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself to see how far you can go\u2014no win condition, just survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Compendium</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and review the skill cards you've acquired as you fill out your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time constraints\u2014plan each turn freely at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergy between dice and cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger surprising combo effects by matching dice rolls with card actions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible resource management and adaptation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to changing situations and make the most of every die and card.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, rich in strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed pacing, solid content\u2014great for casual players and strategy enthusiasts alike.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based strategy game that combines dice and card mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fantasy world filled with spirits and magic, you play as a bounty hunter\u2026 looking to buy a house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Roll dice \u2192 Play skill cards \u2192 Defeat monsters \u2192 Earn rewards \u2192 Pay off your mortgage.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a story about saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one thing that never goes away\u2014your mortgage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time pressure. Take your time and plan each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unpredictable dice rolls, quirky enemies, and diverse skill cards, luck plays a part\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it\u2019s your judgment and strategy that will truly determine your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique cottages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each offers a different set of skills and playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five ascension levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock progressively harder challenges and test your strategic limits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself to see how far you can go\u2014no win condition, just survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Compendium</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and review the skill cards you've acquired as you fill out your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time constraints\u2014plan each turn freely at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergy between dice and cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger surprising combo effects by matching dice rolls with card actions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible resource management and adaptation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to changing situations and make the most of every die and card.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, rich in strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed pacing, solid content\u2014great for casual players and strategy enthusiasts alike.</p>",
    "short_description": "Roll the dice, play your cards, and hunt monsters to pay off your crushing mortgage. This is a quirky turn-based strategy game where survival means managing your luck\u2014and your loans. Glory can wait. The bank won\u2019t.",
